results.strategy_description:
EnSphere's Investment Fund primarily focuses on opportunities on Japan Rates and FX. Japan rates market is local and niche. Experience and deep understanding of JGB market are required to consistently generate alpha. Advantages of EnSphere's investments come from:
a. A unique set of knowledge and experience about pre-1999 Japan’s leading players, funding dynamics, policies. Sufficient precepts to discern practical policy implications vs. what is shown on headlines; 
b. Theoretical and applied expertise in macro cross-asset approaches. This provides the means to weigh how Japan’s interest rates, cross-currency, FX and derivatives tie into other global risk factors, including the intricacies and anomalies of the present market;
c. Advanced research toolkits, that includes proprietary models capitalizing on recent technologies such as statistical and machine learning techniques.

EnSphere believes bond and rates derivatives pricing theory finds its application in markets where organic liquidity and price formation exists. These frameworks do not stem from emotions or observing a narrow set of data points. Rather, when the nature of efficient markets regains traction, a scientific and mathematical approach suits naturally. The investment fund will capture the relevant rates and FX opportunities via a number of sub-strategies which ultimately compliment each other to form an absolute return profile.
